# Fractured Identity: the copy enters the battlefield as a token (CR 111.1, 707.2), so its "when this enters" ability
# triggers for the token's controller, Bot1. On turn 2 Bot2's Flametongue Kavu kills Bot1's Ornithopter; on turn 3 Bot1
# exiles that Kavu, its token copy enters under Bot1's control and its trigger deals 4 damage to Bot2's Embereth
# Shieldbreaker, which dies. The exiled Kavu does not come back to trigger again.

